{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Gaillardia is the mother of Herb, of Herb’s Herbs. They live together in this cozy little hut on a seaside cliff. Gaillardia is agoraphobic and never leaves her home and the surrounding gardens. She is no nonsense, a little grumbly, and is devoted to protecting her grove.\nOn the Edge of Illo’fae stands a cozy looking cottage nestled atop a seaside cliff. It is surrounded by all manner of trees, flowers, and other plants. Butterflies flit from bud to bud, catching the ocean breeze. \nInside the cottage is cluttered with drying plants of all kinds, bubbling pots, and shelves and shelves of magical components. You see a cauldron bearing relief scenes of various heroes embossed on its sides.","created_at":"2021-07-10T18:38:24.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863489353271738369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
