{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Bonafide Bone","id":"467139287192829977","is_bot":0,"username":".bonafidebone"},"author_id":"467139287192829977","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"Eldon looks up from his map unsure of how he got here when trying to return to manhattan \"Oui uh, yes I, je peux aider,\" he shakes his head trying to think straight \"Yes I can help\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:10:50.870000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T19:11:14.737000Z","id":"863497516200493117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"\"oh thank you thank you thank you.  So the lady Gaillardia is known to the lord of the Scales and Feather as someone that can bring back the long dead, without needin a body.  I was tasked to come here and do just that.  The problem is, I have to stay here in a trance while the deal is struck, but some items need obtained.  Would you be willing to find a me few items?\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:12:45.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863497996808749077","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
