{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"863487675116814366","content":"His accent would be from this area, but his speach seems very controlled, like he paces his words.\n\n\"I do not know why these items are needed, but they are somehow tied to the soul being brought back.  A live fish from the waters nearby. At least a drop of healing potion, or of blood from someone that has consumed a healing potion in this city.  A token of lost love.  A leaf from holy ground.  A pinch of fur from a cat that is difficult to catch.  A sandwich made to honor a dragon.  Finally a broken shackle.\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:21:09.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863500112641523743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
